                    "value": "Downtown Eastside has the highest Long-Form GNR at 13.5%, indicating the greatest census-response uncertainty in the Vancouver-focused dataset. Northeast False Creek and Downtown Vancouver both have Data Blindspot Scores of 92.11, yet rank 5th and 14th overall respectively. Census uncertainty should inform confidence in planning evidence, not be interpreted as vulnerability or healthcare need.",
